## English Summary

This project is dual-licensed: **free for personal, non-commercial use**;
**commercial use requires a separate written license** from the author.

Personal use means use by an individual for learning, research, entertainment,
family, or private non-profit purposes, with no connection to commercial
activity. Commercial use — including use within a for-profit organization,
for paid services, or as part of a product or service offered for a fee —
requires prior authorization. Contact the author via GitHub Issues at
https://github.com/hellovm/edge-infer for commercial licensing terms.

The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
